{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40024","headline":"翦刀 · 徐夤","name":"翦刀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宝持多用绣爲囊，双日交加两鬓霜。\n金匣掠平花翡翠，绿窗裁破锦鸳鸯。\n初栽连理枝犹短，误绾同心带不长。\n欲制緼袍先把看，质非纨绮愧銛鋩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40024.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40024","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}